# The sit-downs, "AirPod moments" (V2-14, docs/DESIGN.md §4.1): Mano's thought when he has sat a moment (2.5 s in),
# shown while the song plays in his one ear. Where each one is, its cameras, its song and its journal line are in
# data/world.json "sits"; main.begin_sit plays them. Thoughts only (barks): at most two short sentences each.
# sit_stairs belongs to chapter 4 and sit_final to chapter 5.

~ sit.bay
think: Rue Pasteur through the glass, all gold.
think: A low-budget film. Still a film.

~ sit.planter
think: Seven minutes of sun left. I'm spending them sitting down.
think: Growth.

~ sit.steps
think: Everyone's phone lit up at 18:20. Mine was dead.
think: Story of my night.

~ sit.sofa
think: This sofa has seen more of the BDE than the BDE has.

~ sit.stairs
think: Both AirPods in the case. The music's coming out of my phone, tiny.
think: Still counts.

~ sit.final
think: One day this will just be "that school I went to".
think: Tonight it's the whole world.

# The phone key before chapter 3 (main.open_phone): the dead phone, and a thought
~ phone.dead
if phone_charging
	think: My phone's on the BDE strip, charging. Like I should be.
else
	think: Dead since 17:43. Still dead. Very consistent.

# All six sit-downs (V2-30 "moments 6/6"): the extra thought after the sixth (main.end_sit, flags.moments_all)
~ sit.all
think: Six times tonight, I sat down and just listened.
think: Maybe that's the trick. Stop looking, and things come back.
